speechtext:
One moment. I am pointing out that the revenue is only $252, therefore the salary could not be $220. Now, Mr. Chairman, I regret very much to bring forth such evidence as this. It is not my fault;
Supply-Post Office

I have to do it in self-defence. Hon. gentlemen who are attacking me on these changes in office must take the responsibility. On the one hand, I am accused of not wishing to prosecute this one or that one for theft; on the other hand, I am condemned because" I am not leaving in office men who are found short in their accounts. Let me explain that I do not use the word "shortage" as synonymous with the word "theft." There are many cases of shortages where the postmaster is thoroughly honest, but a continuation of these shortages shows that the postmaster is not administering his office as it should be administered, and consequently he should not be left in charge.
